      "bankId": "b_bce7c24419ef",
      "stem": "执行以下代码，控制台输出顺序是？\n```js\nsetTimeout(() => console.log('A'), 0)\nPromise.resolve().then(() => console.log('B'))\nconsole.log('C')\n```",
      "explanation": "同步代码先执行（C）；宏任务结束后清空微任务队列（B）；setTimeout 回调最后执行（A）。",
      "kpIds": [
        "kp_12cd9bb8a7f8"
      ],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "tags": [],
      "origin": "manual",
      "extensions": {},
